#: app/libs/register.py:51
msgid ""
"用户名格式不正确\n"
"字母开头，长度5-16个字，字母数字下划线组合"
msgstr ""
"The username format is incorrect.\n"
"Starts with a letter, is 5-16 characters long, and is a combination of letters, numbers, and underscores."

#: app/libs/register.py:56
msgid ""
"密码格式不正确\n"
"必须包含大小写字母和数字的组合，可以使用特殊字符，长度在8-10之间"
msgstr ""
"The password format is incorrect.\n"
"It must contain a combination of uppercase and lowercase letters and numbers. Special characters can be used. The length must be between 8 and 10 characters."

